{"version":1,"content":"<p>等到11月尾，氣溫終於有點下降，又是時候約齊朋友打邊爐。</p><p>近日除有內地過江龍登場，又有新火鍋旗艦店供應華麗菜單，再加上素食主題，打邊爐最合時。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;華麗組合&lt;br/&gt;剛於銅鑼灣開設旗艦店的台式</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:23:53.360009+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:00:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:13.410137+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:13.410137+00:00","content_hash":"89e31b62e1e9c02bea5d106ebededea86c7ad10866c5845ed9ddd17fdec75541","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}